#: d82da6b0677143fbb4b58f40b6e07bb8 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:178
msgid "Number of bars in the largest winning trade."
msgstr "最大盈利交易的持仓 K 线数。"

#: 147c3a367cf44a18be2adb3c8a622774 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:184
msgid "Largest loss of a trade, measured in cash."
msgstr "以现金衡量的单笔交易最大亏损。"

#: 779457581b034461b8840b36cdbf8303 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:190
msgid "Largest loss of a trade, measured in percentage."
msgstr "以百分比衡量的单笔交易最大亏损。"

#: f8a2decf304648b49c4813d589fe852f of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:196
msgid "Number of bars in the largest losing trade."
msgstr "最大亏损交易的持仓 K 线数。"

#: 14afff482c034eb885d5febf5ce38f3e of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:202
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive winning trades."
msgstr "最大连续盈利交易笔数。"

#: a9908439ee4944fe8ffb7e7a818392e4 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:208
msgid "Maximum number of consecutive losing trades."
msgstr "最大连续亏损交易笔数。"

#: 9e3fb2657ae9408192157bf97247ee32 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:214
msgid ""
"`Sharpe Ratio <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharpe_ratio>`_, computed "
"per bar."
msgstr ""
"按每根 K 线计算的 `夏普比率（Sharpe Ratio） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharpe_ratio>`_。"

#: 20544cd3fea04ebc99d4ae9ba3dd972a of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:221
msgid ""
"`Sortino Ratio <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_, computed "
"per bar. ``inf`` when there are no losing bars and the mean return is "
"positive."
msgstr ""
"按每根 K 线计算的 `索提诺比率（Sortino Ratio） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_。当没有亏损 K 线且平均收益率为正时为 "
"``inf``。"

#: 8ba0bbf63da54869803fac79293e6323 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:230
msgid ""
"Calmar Ratio: annualized return (CAGR) of the equity curve divided by its"
" maximum drawdown percentage. ``None`` when "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year` is not set, since "
"the ratio annualizes; ``inf`` when there is no drawdown and the equity "
"curve gained."
msgstr ""
"卡玛比率（Calmar Ratio）：权益曲线的复合年增长率（CAGR）除以其最大回撤百分比。由于该比率需要年化，未设置 "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year` 时为 "
"``None``；没有回撤且权益曲线上涨时为 ``inf``。"

#: 3c702ef6072547eb87f7200134783b15 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:240
msgid "Ratio of gross profit to gross loss, computed per bar."
msgstr "按每根 K 线计算的总盈利与总亏损之比。"

#: feae84192a234c60a0d244b5b87d34a0 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:246
msgid ""
"`Ulcer Index <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulcer_index>`_: root mean "
"square of the equity curve's percentage drawdowns from its running peak."
msgstr ""
"`溃疡指数（Ulcer Index） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulcer_index>`_：权益曲线相对其滚动最高点的百分比回撤的均方根值。"

#: 3b2e36a917b4488ea075bf2eafd0f4e0 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:254
msgid ""
"`Ulcer Performance Index <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulcer_index>`_: "
"return divided by the Ulcer Index. The return is annualized (CAGR) when "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year` is set, and is the "
"mean per-bar return otherwise. ``inf`` for a genuinely drawdown-free "
"gain."
msgstr ""
"`溃疡表现指数（Ulcer Performance Index） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulcer_index>`_：收益除以溃疡指数（Ulcer Index）。设置 "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year` "
"时，收益按复合年增长率（CAGR）计算；否则为每根 K 线的平均收益率。对于真正无回撤的收益为 ``inf``。"

#: 14ac9e36cdcf413b84aa007371ac745d of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:265
msgid "R^2 of the equity curve, computed per bar on market values of portfolio."
msgstr "按每根 K 线基于投资组合市值计算的权益曲线 R^2。"

#: 9577fa0cc7f048b8928691224a1bdc29 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:272
msgid ""
"Standard deviation of the portfolio market values across all bars. This "
"measures dispersion of the equity curve's level; it is not a regression "
"standard error."
msgstr "投资组合市值在所有 K 线上的标准差。用于衡量权益曲线水平的离散程度；而非回归标准误差。"

#: cf217a4c2eb9489c8e1ccfba60d5e2e0 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:280
msgid ""
"``std_error`` multiplied by the square root of "
":attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year`."
msgstr ""
"``std_error`` 乘以 :attr:`pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.bars_per_year` "
"的平方根。"

#: 1e8e8a57298d4ca0a459dbd4b9a41c91 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics:287
msgid ""
"Annualized volatility percentage, computed per bar on market values of "
"portfolio."
msgstr "按每根 K 线基于投资组合市值计算的年化波动率百分比。"

#: c90c6b150c7f4874bd8d9aee332a1bb1 of pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics.to_json:1
msgid "Returns JSON-serializable evaluation metrics."
msgstr "返回可 JSON 序列化的评估指标。"

#: ad162b389e2b4c61aef6809588e9ccbc of pybroker.eval.EvalResult:1
msgid "Contains evaluation result."
msgstr "包含评估结果。"

#: 00919bb1ae9f4d47aa5add6ec61fe367 of pybroker.eval.EvalResult:5
msgid "Evaluation metrics."
msgstr "评估指标。"

#: 53443e69070a4a8d8666167599152d27 of pybroker.eval.EvalResult:7
msgid "pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics"
msgstr "pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics"

#: fb2502d9859b4757bd0bb4cbff5b90bd of pybroker.eval.EvalResult:11
