msgstr "平均盈利和平均亏损组成的 ``tuple[float, float]``。"

#: dc725429b06d43529e9b12493d27a043 of pybroker.eval.bca_boot_conf:1
msgid ""
"Computes confidence intervals for a user-defined parameter using the "
"`bias corrected and accelerated (BCa) bootstrap method. "
"<https://blogs.sas.com/content/iml/2017/07/12/bootstrap-bca-"
"interval.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"使用 `偏差校正加速（BCa）自助法 <https://blogs.sas.com/content/iml/2017/07/12"
"/bootstrap-bca-interval.html>`_ 计算用户定义参数的置信区间。"

#: 8aa0dffbc203440cbbae3c131413e3cd of pybroker.eval.bca_boot_conf:5
msgid ""
":class:`numpy.ndarray` containing the data for the randomized bootstrap "
"sampling."
msgstr "用于随机自助法抽样的数据 :class:`numpy.ndarray`。"

#: 04efb971436e4019b3fbfdddb6e09d94 of pybroker.eval.bca_boot_conf:8
msgid ""
":class:`Callable` for computing the parameter used for the confidence "
"intervals."
msgstr "用于计算置信区间所需参数的 :class:`Callable`。"

#: 14029922c5094ad8bdab0cd4fb430ae9 of pybroker.eval.bca_boot_conf:11
msgid ":class:`.BootConfIntervals` containing the computed confidence intervals."
msgstr "包含计算出的置信区间的 :class:`.BootConfIntervals`。"

#: 30cff96b9736438d8f1e4549c0e9c441 of pybroker.eval.bootstrap_eval_all:1
msgid "Computes all bootstrap metrics in one shared resampling pass."
msgstr "在一次共享的重采样过程中计算所有自助法指标。"

#: b910e0de240e49af8582a6aa08dae273 of pybroker.eval.calmar_ratio:1
msgid ""
"Computes the Calmar Ratio, defined as the annualized return (CAGR of the "
"compounded ``returns``) divided by the maximum drawdown percentage of the"
" compounded ``returns``."
msgstr "计算卡玛比率（Calmar Ratio），即 ``returns`` 复利累积序列的复合年增长率（CAGR）除以该序列的最大回撤百分比。"

#: 0f765d16a6a0451ba3adc61dbdf22226 8e1ceebb037e40948198188531b7116a
#: e1363ad49ada4f1a88d9ca3985e90742 f63f72a09db44d38a5d04c8bcc04880a
#: f9b506268579492c8a14341bcc191e4f of pybroker.eval.calmar_ratio:5
#: pybroker.eval.downside_deviation:7 pybroker.eval.max_drawdown_percent:3
#: pybroker.eval.sharpe_ratio:5 pybroker.eval.sortino_ratio:10
msgid "Array of returns centered at 0."
msgstr "以 0 为中心的收益率数组。"

#: 7d6fa18c77fd48a0b0fa9866f9679581 of pybroker.eval.conf_profit_factor:1
msgid "Computes confidence intervals for ``profit_factor``."
msgstr "计算 ``profit_factor`` 的置信区间。"

#: c6d1531ec889445dad7b09ee9550b7d9 of pybroker.eval.conf_sharpe_ratio:1
msgid "Computes confidence intervals for :func:`.sharpe_ratio`."
msgstr "计算 :func:`.sharpe_ratio` 的置信区间。"

#: 40765770b7204cb29716556e21781910 of pybroker.eval.downside_deviation:1
msgid ""
"Computes downside deviation, the denominator of the `Sortino Ratio "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_."
msgstr ""
"计算下行标准差，即 `索提诺比率（Sortino Ratio） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_ 的分母。"

#: fb757b20ccb74968ac763f2550604a3f of pybroker.eval.downside_deviation:4
msgid ""
"Negative returns are squared about zero and averaged over **all** "
"observations, not just the negative ones."
msgstr "负收益率相对于零取平方，并对 **所有** 观测值求平均，而不仅仅是负收益率的观测值。"

#: 7093ae2d84af40acac57cc349a7c8f41 of pybroker.eval.iqr:1
msgid ""
"Computes the `interquartile range (IQR) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interquartile_range>`_ of ``values``."
msgstr ""
"计算 ``values`` 的 `四分位距（IQR） "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interquartile_range>`_。"

#: 4a1ccb8ddc444304b6dfe93b0a6ed953 of pybroker.eval.largest_win_loss:1
msgid "Computes the largest profit and largest loss of all trades."
msgstr "计算所有交易中的最大盈利和最大亏损。"

#: 9f6a724dc9ed404d81c7a5b3e0f50b8f of pybroker.eval.largest_win_loss:5
msgid "``tuple[float, float]`` of largest profit and largest loss."
msgstr "最大盈利和最大亏损组成的 ``tuple[float, float]``。"

#: b1bf0839df5646b2baab18130232572b of pybroker.eval.log_profit_factor:1
msgid ""
"Computes the log transformed profit factor, which is the ratio of gross "
"profit to gross loss."
msgstr "计算对数变换后的盈利因子，即总盈利与总亏损之比。"

#: ef68501d247744c6b2c8ddd8c3cd8195 of pybroker.eval.log_profit_factor:4
msgid "Array of differences between each bar and the previous bar."
msgstr "每根 K 线与前一根 K 线之差组成的数组。"

#: 7ecae91857a34c1e9aa2f4617ba16eec of pybroker.eval.max_drawdown_percent:1
msgid "Computes maximum drawdown, measured in percentage loss."
msgstr "计算以百分比亏损衡量的最大回撤。"

#: 2ff2541a3cc143168aef1e9457e536e5 of pybroker.eval.max_drawdown_percent:5
msgid ""
"- Maximum drawdown, measured in percentage loss. - Index of the maximum "
"drawdown."
msgstr "- 以百分比亏损衡量的最大回撤。 - 最大回撤发生处的索引。"

#: bed728d1ce6846ca833064088141d6ff of pybroker.eval.max_drawdown_percent:7
msgid "Maximum drawdown, measured in percentage loss."
msgstr "以百分比亏损衡量的最大回撤。"

#: 7cf771e03ad94bb9bb5d50f455e4dfda of pybroker.eval.max_drawdown_percent:8
msgid "Index of the maximum drawdown."
msgstr "最大回撤发生处的索引。"

#: 2575d476f0a14086978aaba96f2589e0 of pybroker.eval.max_wins_losses:1
msgid "Computes the max consecutive wins and max consecutive losses."
msgstr "计算最大连续盈利次数和最大连续亏损次数。"

#: 2e918b03a3d8479fbee45f2e4942b6ba of pybroker.eval.max_wins_losses:5
msgid "``tuple[int, int]`` of max consecutive wins and max consecutive losses."
msgstr "最大连续盈利次数和最大连续亏损次数组成的 ``tuple[int, int]``。"

#: 3727a29e75b345a2a57135efa8cecf33 of pybroker.eval.r_squared:1
msgid "Computes R-squared of ``values``."
msgstr "计算 ``values`` 的 R 平方。"

#: 6c5f088298f0436faa9374fd76b91d57 of pybroker.eval.relative_entropy:1
msgid ""
"Computes the relative `entropy "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entropy_(information_theory)>`_."
msgstr "计算相对 `熵 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entropy_(information_theory)>`_。"

#: 5972b4d619104b51aded9b7674de2410 of pybroker.eval.sharpe_ratio:1
msgid ""
"Computes the `Sharpe Ratio "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharpe_ratio>`_, using the population "
"standard deviation of ``returns``."
msgstr ""
"计算 `夏普比率（Sharpe Ratio） <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharpe_ratio>`_，使用 "
"``returns`` 的总体标准差。"

#: 9e75d48938a446b68f3311c0bdf2b6d4 of pybroker.eval.sharpe_ratio:6
msgid ""
"Number of observations used to annualize the Sharpe Ratio. For example, a"
" value of ``252`` would be used to annualize daily returns."
msgstr "用于年化夏普比率的观测数量。例如，日线收益率使用 ``252``。"

#: 7c11bff8664f456ab29ba527a960cac6 of pybroker.eval.sortino_ratio:1
msgid ""
"Computes the `Sortino Ratio "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_."
msgstr "计算 `索提诺比率（Sortino Ratio） <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sortino_ratio>`_。"

#: 6fd1dc96ec834a589b8ae2ed3c7b6096 of pybroker.eval.sortino_ratio:4
msgid ""
"With no downside to divide by the ratio is unbounded, so a positive mean "
"returns ``inf`` -- genuinely the best score, and one Optuna accepts -- "
"while a non-positive mean returns ``0``. ``NaN`` is reserved for returns "
"that are not computable at all, because a NaN score marks an Optuna trial"
" *failed* and would discard the run rather than rank it."
msgstr ""
"当没有下行波动可作除数时，该比率是无界的，因此平均收益率为正时返回 ``inf`` —— 这确实是最佳得分，Optuna 也能接受 —— "
"而平均收益率非正时返回 ``0``。``NaN`` 则保留给完全无法计算的情况，因为 NaN 得分会将一次 Optuna 试验标记为 "
"*失败*，从而丢弃该次运行，而不是对其排名。"

#: 71e7e78ea2454be9b93dd5837d4c88c1 of pybroker.eval.sortino_ratio:11
msgid ""
"Number of observations used to annualize the Sortino Ratio. For example, "
"a value of ``252`` would be used to annualize daily returns."
msgstr "用于年化索提诺比率的观测数量。例如，日线收益率使用 ``252``。"

#: 2e08ebbfaf8b4d87bc115d3fc2ce55d2 of pybroker.eval.total_profit_loss:1
msgid "Computes total profit and loss."
msgstr "计算总盈亏。"

#: 7b063bfed25b49239bb721ae9ae74ef9 of pybroker.eval.total_profit_loss:5
msgid "``tuple[float, float]`` of total profit and total loss."
